  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Attribution of disruptive hybrid attacks to vendors or equipment tied to adversary jurisdictions prompts German firms and regulators to accelerate supplier substitution and procurement from trusted partners, directly reducing reliance on those external technology sources.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d39">germany_industry_transit</data>
</edge>
