  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Intensified Russian hybrid operations (drones, loitering munitions, cyber/EM techniques) create operational templates and readily transferable systems that Iran and regional proxies imitate or acquire, raising the rate of deniable maritime incidents in the Gulf.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war</data>
