  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Greater opacity around incidents and intentions increases investor uncertainty about geopolitical and regulatory risk for large‑scale compute projects, causing financiers to delay or withdraw capital allocations to AI compute deployments tied to cross‑border supply chains.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war</data>
