  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.65</data>
  <data key="d36">Higher marine insurance and freight premiums for Gulf-origin shipments increase landed costs for semiconductor components and finished accelerators, which producers and distributors pass through as higher chip and accelerator prices.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">iran_hormuz_escalation</data>
