  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.75</data>
  <data key="d36">Higher global spot oil prices translate into larger near‑term export revenues and FX inflows for Russia, enabling increased procurement, sustainment and operational spending that sustain or expand conventional military operations in Ukraine.</data>
