  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Increased private and institutional capital deployed to large‑scale AI compute accelerates development and deployment of generative models and automated media‑synthesis/analysis tooling that adversaries and proxies can use to fabricate or obfuscate battlefield imagery and messaging, making event verification harder.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
