  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.75</data>
  <data key="d36">Increased fragility in German transit routes and logistics (ports, rail links, customs processing) directly delays or reduces shipments of accelerator components and finished GPUs, lowering available accelerator production/shipment capacity to US/China markets.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
